	(text "74HCT244 shifts 3.3 V GPIO to 5 V gate drive and isolates the Pi from the power stage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "38f90c7f-b898-4438-8e2a-d4eff0333b27")
	)
	(text "Per channel: 100R gate resistor, 10k gate pull-down (off while the Pi boots or is absent),\nAOD4184A 40 V low-side switch, SS54 freewheel diode to VIN, status LED on the 5 V drive signal.\nQ1/Q2 = hardware PWM (light, fan). Terminal: pin 1 = +VIN, pin 2 = switched OUT (load between)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 109.22 0)
		(effects
